Melodee v1.6.1 – browser emulator (web/emu), built from https://github.com/keremimo/melodee tag v1.6.1 (commit 165d177a425944f3d30b0b669255a6ed0050c3a5).
GPL-3.0-only. Copyright (C) 2026 Kerem Kilic (Ellic Studio); portions Copyright (C) 2026 Leo Kuroshita, Hügelton Instruments (Felucca).
Ported parts keep their licences (msfa in fm6_core.c: Apache-2.0, Dexed: GPL-3.0-or-later; MAME's uPD933 in cz_native.c: BSD-3-Clause; DaisySP and Rings in the PHYS engine: MIT;
reSID's models and measured data in the SID engine: GPL-2.0-or-later, used under GPL-3.0; the UI face is rasterised in: OFL 1.1): Melodee's LICENSING.md and the texts in THIRD_PARTY.txt beside this file.
Where this Melodee version has the CZ-1 and PROPHET engines, it contains Casio's 64 CZ-1 preset tones and the Sequential Prophet-5/10 factory programs as sound data, included as in Melodee's own releases;
their rights stay with Casio and Sequential, and Melodee's LICENSING.md states that no licence is granted for them by that project (nor by FM-1 Companion).
The JieLi SDK files of Melodee's packages are not part of this build.
Compiled with WASI SDK clang instead of Emscripten; include shim tools/wasm_shim/sys/wait.h (fork/pipe stubs for unused host-test helpers). Page: version filled in, installer link points to the official site, ../_host/fm1sim-host.js is loaded.

Corresponding Source (GNU GPL 3.0, section 6)
